# OPERATIONS §2.3 (M3): check's inputs are run's, no asks; `--ask` is a usage error: the usage text, exit 2 (§2.3
# "2 for a usage error"; INTERFACE §1: a usage text of the engine's own, no check reads its words). Run as the
# command line runs it, `check model.tally --ask q`.
=== options disk check args=--ask,q exit=2
=== model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source card "a card (invented)"

ask q: 1
